@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Nanum Gothic
scale max 1920 width
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title Chat Notification Entry, Unread Boundary and Receipts
actor User
participant "NotificationService" as Notification
participant "LinkedChatEntryUI" as Entry
participant "LinkPatientCaregiver" as Link
participant "LinkedChatUI" as UI
participant "LinkedChatHistoryViewModel" as History
participant "ManageLinkedChat" as Control
participant "LinkedChatRealtimeService" as Realtime
participant "Chat API / Repository" as API
participant "Other participant" as Peer

== 일반 채팅의 대화별 알림 ==
Control -> API : requestNotificationSummary()\nGET unread-count?include_notification_preview=true
API --> Control : unread_count + notification\n(build_chat_notification_summary: 최근 최대 세 건·표시 정책·group_tag)
Control --> Notification : ChatNotificationSummary (deliverLinkedChatAlert)
Notification -> Notification : showLinkedChatAlert(summary)\n같은 group_tag의 이전 알림을 대화별 요약으로 교체
note over Notification,API
  FCM 경로는 DispatchChatMessageAlert가 같은 요약을 chat_summary로 담아 보낸다.
  요약 조회가 실패하거나 구형 서버이면 이번 메시지만으로 알림을 표시한다.
  내용 숨김은 상대 이름·본문을 숨기고 기록 공유는 일반 안내만 표시한다.
  기기에 수신 메시지를 누적해 개수를 추정하지 않는다.
end note

== 오늘 보호자 확인 요청의 실행 알림 ==
API -> API : 저장된 slot_check_request의 보호자→환자 역할·오늘 날짜·정기 시간대 확인
alt supports_slot_check_actions를 등록한 Android
  API -> Notification : FCM data-only → SlotCheckNotificationService.display()\naction_version=1 + 원래 날짜·환자·연동·메시지 ID
  Notification -> Notification : 현재 기기 계정·오늘 날짜 검사\n메시지별 태그 + 화면 없는 복용 완료 버튼
  opt 환자가 복용 완료 버튼 선택
    User -> Notification : 복용 완료
    Notification -> Notification : SlotCheckNotificationService.handle()\n계정·날짜 재검사 후 암호화 outbox 저장·기존 동기화
    note right of Notification
      소비 표식과 완료 의도를 함께 저장한다.
      세부 복구·서버 계약은 OfflineDoseSync.puml을 따른다.
      버튼 처리는 채팅 읽음이나 즉시 서버 반영을 뜻하지 않는다.
    end note
else 구버전·미지원 기기 또는 실행 조건 없는 메시지
  API -> Notification : 기존 OS 채팅 알림; 복용 버튼 없음
end
note over Notification,API
  전경 연동 감시도 현재 보호자→환자 요청의 날짜를 확인해 같은 실행 문맥을 쓴다.
  capability 기본값은 false이며 새 Android 등록 때만 활성화한다.
  f7a2c9e4b610 마이그레이션은 서버보다 먼저 적용한다.
end note

== 본문 선택과 읽음 처리 ==
User -> Notification : Tap chat notification / inbox entry
Notification -> Notification : validate recipient and destination type
alt Same linked conversation already open
  Notification -> UI : request latest position; keep draft
else New conversation route
  Notification -> Entry : account, link ID and pending action
  Entry -> Link : load active links
  Link --> Entry : current patient/caregiver role and peer
  Entry -> UI : verified role, patient hash and current settings
end
UI -> History : initialize / coalesced refresh
History -> Control : recent history + unread summary
Control -> API : GET messages / unread-count
API --> History : recent page + count + first_unread_message_id
History -> History : fix unread boundary for this visit
History --> UI : immutable reconciled history
UI --> User : latest message (reverse-list offset 0)

alt Foreground + current route + latest position
  UI -> History : visible/latest-position predicates
  History -> Control : markRead(latest incoming ID)
  Control -> API : POST read; deduplicate acknowledged range
  API --> Peer : read event
  Peer -> Peer : remove outgoing unread 1
  API --> History : 읽음 범위 갱신 성공
  History -> Notification : onRead → clearReadChatAlert(owner, linkId, throughMessageId)
  Notification -> Notification : 해당 그룹 알림 정리\n더 최신 메시지 알림은 유지하고 오래된 요약 재표시 방지
else Older history / covered route / background
  UI -> UI : preserve scroll; defer read request
end

opt Message action sheet
  User -> UI : 길게 눌러 복사 (삭제되지 않은 본문만)
  UI -> UI : Clipboard.setData(body); 서버 요청 없음
end

User -> UI : Scroll toward older messages
UI -> History : loadOlderMessages()
History -> Control : request previous page (before_id, limit 50)
Control -> API : authorized visible history
API --> History : older page; preserve first-unread divider
Peer --> History : incoming message or read event
History -> History : merge by ID; never roll back read/deletion evidence
History --> UI : read-only snapshot; presentation keeps draft/scroll
note over UI,History
  Account/link/patient changes replace the identity-keyed session.
  Disposal invalidates history and composer responses, timers and subscriptions.
  Same-conversation settings/notification re-entry preserves its draft.
  Borrowed authenticated adapters stay owned by presentation.
  LinkedChatComposerViewModel owns sends/retry IDs; UI keeps text fields.
end note
note over UI,API
  Message-list counts and local notification-inbox counts are distinct.
  Hidden/deleted/own messages do not count as incoming unread messages.
  Active chat-list refresh is bounded polling, not a global realtime badge.
end note
opt History read or failed-send follow-up confirms HTTP 403/404
  History -> History : linkUnavailable = true; stop fallback polling
  History -> Realtime : stop()
  History --> UI : link unavailable snapshot
  UI --> User : replace composer with link-ended notice
end
note over Realtime,API
  Current clients declare chat-close-codes on the stream handshake.
  Rejected handshakes are accepted only to send the cause-specific close code;
  they are not registered as authorized chat connections.
  Legacy clients retain pre-accept rejection. Token refresh, backoff and terminal
  link failures stay distinct; chat_ready resets the reconnect attempt.
end note
@enduml
